SUMMARY:Green River Cove Trail
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n[https://www.alltrails.com/trail/u
 s/north-carolina/green-river-cove-trail?sh=pacpnj&utm_medium=trail_share&u
 tm_source=alltrails_virality](https://www.alltrails.com/trail/us/north-car
 olina/green-river-cove-trail?sh=pacpnj&utm_medium=trail_share&utm_source=a
 lltrails_virality)\n\nsee AllTrails link above\n\nout and back along the g
 reen river\, haven't been there in a while but am told it's nicely shaded 
 currently\n\nanticipated pace 2.5 ish mph\n\nwell-behaved dogs are welcome
 !\n\nper previous hikes:\n\ngear up as appropriate\, trekking poles are an
  option. bring a snack as we'll take a break mid-hike. and plenty of water
 \n\nground rules: 1) if you sign up\, show up or change your status. 2 ) b
 e sure you are in adequate physical shape to complete the event. 3) show c
 onsideration toward all attendees. I hike for stress reduction and want to
  keep it that way as much as possible\n\nLEGALESE\nThis Asheville Hiking G
 roup event involves hiking and\, possibly\, transportation to and from the
  meetup site. Participants are responsible for their own safety and affirm
  that they have the appropriate skills\, physical conditioning\, equipment
 \, and supplies. Hiking may involve risks to oneself and property. Neither
  your hike organizer nor Asheville Hiking Group can assure your safety nor
  eliminate all risks. By signing up for this event\, participant understan
 ds and agrees
